11.8 🏢 In the organisation
Before any AI feature goes live:

run a Data Protection Impact Assessment (NDPA 2023);
decide which data classes may reach which model (public API, enterprise API with no training on your data, or local model);
log every prompt and response;
name a human accountable for each AI-assisted decision.

The value is real (minutes instead of days to read 3,000 complaints), and so is the governance work it requires.

14.6 Backfills and reprocessing
Because bronze keeps everything and silver and gold are pure functions of bronze, reprocessing history is just a re-run. When a cleaning rule changes (say, a new duplicate rule), you:

change the rule in code, in a pull request;
rebuild silver and gold from bronze;
compare old and new gold (the reconciliation test, against yesterday’s mart);
publish, and note the restatement in the change log.

This is the payoff of never editing bronze.
